<Text><![CDATA[The same for every layout. Outbound: arrive, stock check (hold if short), wait for a cart (wave release), cart tour by a picker, pack, staging until cut-off, ship. Inbound: arrive, receive, putaway trip, stock up (releases held orders).]]></Text>
